<div class="sourceCode" id="cb13"><pre
class="sourceCode typescript"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb13-1"><a href="#cb13-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">//   Never log full JWTs</span></span>
